\centering
\small
\caption{$\pi_{0.5}$ attention vs.\ random at $k{=}0.5$ across LIBERO suites. Attention is neutral on 3/4 suites but catastrophically harmful on Object.}
\label{tab:pi05_attention_crosssuite}

